note S4 out: inside the unit an out is a sized edit; an internal function fills a local through it
note and reads it back. Exit 0 when the values hold.
om2
fn fill r out ulong 3 v ulong to ulong
for i ulong 3
put r i add v i
end
ret get r 2
end
fn main to int
a = new ulong 3 0
if ne fill a 10 12
ret 1
end
if ne get a 0 10
ret 2
end
ret 0
end
